Hello,

<% if @first_year %>
  Thank you for being a part of GitHub for Startups!

  We're reaching out <%= @days_to_expire == 5 ? "one last time " : "" %>because your program expiration is coming up in <%= @days_to_expire %> days.

  <% case @days_to_expire %>
  <% when 30 %>
    Want to continue on GitHub Enterprise? We're offering startups associated with an approved GitHub for Startups partner (<%= "#{GitHub.help_url}/enterprise/startups/partners" %>)
    a 50% discount on GitHub Enterprise for their second year in the program.

    GitHub for Startups Enterprise features", (<%= pricing_url %>):

    - 50K Action mins per month
    - User Management (SSO)
    - Organizational Controls (SOC)
    - ...and exclusive events, office hours, and webinars!

    Interested in GitHub Advanced Security? We're also inviting startups returning to the program and new to Advanced security
    a 50% discount on GitHub Advanced Security!

    - Code Scanning (<%= DocsUrlConfig.url_for("code-security/about-code-scanning") %>) - Search for potential security vulnerabilities and coding errors in your code.
    - Secret Scanning (<%= "#{GitHub.help_url}/code-security/secret-scanning/about-secret-scanning" %>) - Detect secrets (keys, tokens, etc.) that have been checked into private repos.
    - Dependency Review (<%= "#{GitHub.help_url}/code-security/supply-chain-security/understanding-your-software-supply-chain/about-dependency-review" %>) - Show the full impact of changes to dependencies and vulnerable versions before you merge a pull request.

    If you're interested in the GitHub Advanced Security offer: Please respond to this email and we'll connect you to someone for an evaluation!

    If you'd like to continue with only the GitHub for Startups Year 2 offer: Please keep an eye out for a follow up email in 2 weeks with further
    instructions - until then, we recommend reviewing the users in your Enterprise (<%= "#{GitHub.help_url}/enterprise-cloud@latest/admin/user-management/managing-users-in-your-enterprise/viewing-people-in-your-enterprise" %>)
    and ensuring you have a payment method on file as you'll be charged for the number of licenses in your Enterprise ($10.50 each) immediately upon renewal.
  <% when 14 %>
      Want to continue on GitHub Enterprise? We're offering startups associated with an approved GitHub for Startups partner (<%= "#{GitHub.help_url}/enterprise/startups/partners" %>)
      a 50% discount on GitHub Enterprise for their second year in the program. We're also offering a 50% discount on GitHub Advanced Security - let us know if you're interested in learning more!

      If you'd like to continue with the GitHub for Startups Year 2 Enterprise offer:

      - 1. Review the users in your Enterprise (<%= "#{GitHub.help_url}/enterprise-cloud@latest/admin/user-management/managing-users-in-your-enterprise/viewing-people-in-your-enterprise" %>) and adjust the number of licenses in your Enterprise as you'll be charged $10.50 per license immediately upon renewal.
      - 2. Ensure you have a valid payment method on file
      - 3. Respond to this email within a week and specify which GFS partner (<%= "https://github.com/enterprise/startups/partners" %>) you're affiliated with.

      We'll apply the discount a few days before your program expiration date to ensure a seamless transition.
  <% when 5 %>
      Want to continue on GitHub Enterprise? We're offering startups associated with an approved GitHub for Startups partner (<%= "#{GitHub.help_url}/enterprise/startups/partners" %>)
      a 50% discount on GitHub Enterprise for their second year in the program.

      If you'd like to continue with the GitHub for Startups Year 2 offer:

      - 1. Review the users in your Enterprise (<%= "#{GitHub.help_url}/enterprise-cloud@latest/admin/user-management/managing-users-in-your-enterprise/viewing-people-in-your-enterprise" %>) and adjust the number of licenses in your Enterprise as you'll be charged $10.50 per license immediately upon renewal.
      - 2. Ensure you have a valid payment method on file
      - 3. Respond to this email ASAP and specify which GFS partner (<%= "https://github.com/enterprise/startups/partners" %>) you're affiliated with.
  <% end %>

  If you are not looking to continue on GitHub Enterprise: please ensure you delete your Enterprise Account (<%= "#{GitHub.help_url}/enterprise-cloud@latest/admin/managing-your-enterprise-account/deleting-an-enterprise-account" %>)
  before your program end date. Failure to do so will result in getting charged for GitHub Enterprise upon program expiration.

  Thank you again for building with GitHub for Startups! Feel free to reach out to us in the GitHub for Startup support portal (<%= "#{GitHub.support_url}/contact?tags=hh-github-for-startups" %>) if you have any questions.
<% else %>
    We're reaching out because your program graduation is coming up in <%= @days_to_expire %> days.
    Thank you for having been a part of GitHub for Startups!

    At this time, we're offering you a GitHub for Startups graduation discount redeemable within 30 days of program graduation.

    - Evaluation + GitHub Enterprise - 20% discount
    - Evaluation + GitHub Enterprise + Advanced Security - 25% discount

    If you're interested in the above, please respond to this email at your earliest convenience.

    If you are not looking to continue on GitHub Enterprise: please ensure you delete your Enterprise Account (<%= "#{GitHub.help_url}/enterprise-cloud@latest/admin/managing-your-enterprise-account/deleting-an-enterprise-account" %>)
    before your program end date. Failure to do so will result in getting charged for GitHub Enterprise upon program expiration.

    Regards,
<% end %>

The GitHub for Startups Team

